<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LEIPZIG, Germany 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000 Leipzig women's tournament on Wednesday (prefix numbers denote seeding):</p>
<p>First round: 5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Second round: 3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>6-Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4.</p>
<p>Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Samantha Smith (Britain) 6-1 6-2</p>
</text>
